                <br/>
                Here is your Grave number <b><t t-out="object.allocated_grave_id.number or ''"/></b> and grave name <b><t t-out="object.allocated_grave_id.name or ''"/></b>

                <br/>Thank you for your trust!
                <br/><br/>Do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions.
        <t t-if="not is_html_empty(object.env.user.signature)">
            <br/><br/>
            <t t-out="object.env.user.signature or ''">--<br/>Mitchell Admin</t>
        </t>
        <br/><br/>
            </p>
            </div>
        </field>
